| Bet Type | Selections | Total Bets | Includes Singles | £1 Stake Cost |
|----------|-----------|------------|------------------|---------------|
| Lucky 15 | 4 | 15 | Yes | £15 |
| Heinz | 6 | 57 | No | £57 |
| Super Heinz | 7 | 120 | No | £120 |
| Goliath | 8 | 247 | No | £247 |
The key distinction lies in coverage versus cost. The Lucky 15 protects bettors with singles coverage, meaning returns start with just one winner. The Heinz, Super Heinz, and Goliath eliminate singles, requiring at least two selections to win for any return. This increases risk but reduces the total number of bets compared to including all singles.
